UID:10106572-1793934000-1794020399@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:COMING Friday November 20th | Last Waltz – A 50th Anniversary Celebration
DESCRIPTION:November 20\, 2026 8:00 PM | From $22.71 adv. Event Details and Tickets \nHey everyone we are thrilled to announce that members of @cloudsofdelusionofficial and @sunsofstars are coming together to celebrate the 50th anniversary of The Last Waltz at Pisgah Brewing Company! Inspired by The Band’s legendary farewell concert at San Francisco’s Winterland Ballroom on Thanksgiving Day 1976\, our local musicians recreate one of the most celebrated nights in rock history. \n\n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom with live music several days a week\, plus our outdoor music venue in the summer and fall months with live music frequently on WNC’s premier outdoor music venue\, the Pisgah Brewing Outdoor Stage. Be sure to come thirsty and ready rock! Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-friday-november-20th-last-waltz-a-50th-anniversary-celebration/2026-11-06/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/last-waltz-a-50th-anniversary-celebration-e1793029777720.jpeg
GEO:35.6068069;-82.3568213
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain 2948 US-70 Black Mountain NC 28711;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2948 US-70:geo:-82.3568213,35.6068069
END:VEVENT
