SUMMARY:Asheville Choral Society w/ Asheville Waldorf Singers
DESCRIPTION:Experience Sir John Rutter’s beautiful and moving Mass of the Children\, performed by the Asheville Choral Society with young singers from a local Waldorf school – Asheville Waldorf Singers – professional soloists\, and world-class organist.\nRutter’s beloved work brings together the voices of children and adults in a powerful musical conversation—moving from intimate\, reflective moments to the sweeping sound of a full chorus. It is music about connection\, hope\, wonder\, and the extraordinary things that can happen when different voices become one.\nAs part of ACS’s 2026–27 Come Together season\, this performance is an invitation to experience the power of live music—and to share it across generations.\n Saturday\, November 7\, 2026 | 4 PM\n\nAdult Ticket\, $25.00 Event Details and Tickets \nCentral United Methodist Church\, 27 Church St.\, Asheville
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/asheville-choral-society-presents-sanctuary/2026-11-07/
LOCATION:Central United Methodist Church of Asheville
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR